-- An #EVALTRACE that never ends. A directive that collects a trace keeps a
-- record of every step, so it has a lower work number of its own, 100,000
-- steps (decided by Claude 2026-11-21, pending Meng's review), and its stop says so.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
countDown n MEANS IF n EQUALS 0 THEN 0 ELSE countDown (n - 2)

#EVALTRACE countDown 5
